{"id": "1538032190447689798", "channel_id": "1538032190447689798", "author_id": "216404743545815041", "author_name": ".gallatine", "content": "Hi,\n\nI enjoy playing traphase.\nBut the slowest thing to do here is learning by reading each of every character in trapphase.\nEspecially since the UI make it hard to read everything at once. \nAnd memory is not perfect, sometimes I often think \"Wait, I think I read a character that has synergistic kit?\" -> and proceed to browse characters page again.\n\nMy suggestion is, can you make it so the display is like the \"Skills\" section in the Awakener menu.\nExalt and every card listed in one page in easy and quick to read format.", "timestamp": "2026-08-15T03:50:49.459000+00:00", "thread_id": "1538032190447689798", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-15T04:10:42.230000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1538032191177752606", "filename": "Screenshot_2026-08-15_104551.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 2945553, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1538032190447689798/1538032191177752606/Screenshot_2026-08-15_104551.png?ex=6a813399&is=6a7fe219&hm=0d40b9ac3c309423cf82efe5a1e020d2da9c28b04f15ed9ee1d822ec63681ed1&"}], "thread_title": "QOL Improvement for Traphase - ease of readability", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1361168939622727801"], "is_thread_starter": true}
